## Development Server Ports

| Server | Port | URL |
|--------|------|-----|
| Frontend | [PORT] | http://localhost:[PORT] |
| Backend | [PORT] | http://localhost:[PORT] |

Servers must always use the configured ports. Before starting E2E tests, browser verification, or development servers, stop any existing process on the configured ports. After work finishes, stop the servers and verify the ports are no longer LISTENING.

For worktree-based parallel development, use the main checkout's `.worktrees/.ports.json` from the `worktree-parallel` skill and use only the allocated ports.
